 a bit troubled a lot of  the Rajasa tea is contained in a sort of  classical language rather than being  overly excessive the contrasting  character is you say B Asst who is  introverted sensitive and contemplative  [Music]  in line with these character contrasts a  wide range of dynamics occur in his  music and again Schumann is never shy  about quickly switching emotional gears  [Music]  these shifts often follow the arcs of a  narrative story that is being implied  the script of titles often help in this  regard another common theme is to have  march-like excursions that are poised  with an air of optimism  and of course you'll find plenty of  contrapuntal lines that add complexity  to the texture now with all of that in  mind here is happy birthday in the style  of robert schumann  [Music]  you  [Music]  follow the link in the description to  check out other birthday homages I've  released previously thank you for  watching and I'll see you in the next  video
 

